  m_Name: Pilote -Mail Refomation Program
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Reeducation Program
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: 'Good morning,


    The Board has decided to send some of the less reliable
    employees on the Reeducation Program today. Here are the criteria you should
    look for:


    - anyone who took a break of more than 45 consecutive minutes.

    -
    anyone who took more than one hour''s worth of breaks in total.

    - anyone
    who arrived after 9am or before 8:15am (except for anyone working in overseeing,
    starting at 8am).

    - anyone with a majority of E''s on their H.E.A.L.T.H
    score.

    - anyone who did not fulfill their report correctly.'
